  <title id="bdl15ivonimagenet-title">Validation error of IVON and AdamW for a ResNet-50 on ImageNet over training</title>
  <desc id="bdl15ivonimagenet-desc">Validation error, from about 75 down to about 20, against the training step in thousands from 0 to 250. Both curves fall steeply in the first few thousand steps. For most of training the AdamW curve lies slightly below the IVON curve, at about 35 against 37 after 100,000 steps; toward the end the IVON curve drops faster and finishes below AdamW at about 23 against 25. Arrows mark the points reached after 12 hours, near step 105,000, and after 24 hours, near step 222,000. The curves are smooth approximations traced from the published figure.</desc>
